{"type":"text","timestamp":1778877988855,"sessionID":"ses_1d29c3b77ffe0TXS8qv1lJEp7L","part":{"id":"prt_e2d63fe6a001zQIGG6Oxqo9zf9","messageID":"msg_e2d63dea2001O3wHrVix6jIe4n","sessionID":"ses_1d29c3b77ffe0TXS8qv1lJEp7L","type":"text","text":"I’ve got enough to see the pattern: predictor-heavy ideas keep overpaying on fetch-path logic, and the only strong win was earlier control-flow retiming. I’m checking whether there’s a smaller micro-opt version of that win that avoids widening IF.","time":{"start":1778877988458,"end":1778877988853},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0db8c3c2b611be5b016a0786245830819b8c089af992f08e14","phase":"commentary"}}}}
