ed next PC forward.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Recognize JAL in fetch, compute its target immediately, and mark the prediction as valid for the downstream stages.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Latch the prediction sideband with the decoded instruction so EX can compare the predicted and resolved next PCs.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Suppress the redundant redirect on correctly predicted JALs while keeping JALR and branch resolution unchanged.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 4, \"confidence\": \"low\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file...","metadata":{"matches":1,"truncated":false},"title":"hyp-20260515-003-r11s2","time":{"start":1778884155288,"end":1778884155338}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0d863f0e6ba826a0016a079e3b31c881999cbc71e1c1fef465"}},"id":"prt_e2dc21794001ZELI8P1N064wb5","sessionID":"ses_1d23e8f15ffehkUuPe0PG0dScm","messageID":"msg_e2dc1b9af0015gUIfpvbW5Ws56"}}
