age.sv\", \"description\": \"Add the canonical return lookup in fetch and feed its predicted next PC into the existing control-flow path.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Train the return predictor from resolved JAL/JALR control fl...","metadata":{"matches":39,"truncated":false},"title":"micro_opt|forward|hazard|stall|source-use|source use|load-use|wb_stage|mem_stage|fetch buffer|predictor","time":{"start":1778886222333,"end":1778886222358}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_04f9108dc8da3873016a07a64e2c84819984b1eb6482eb511b"}},"id":"prt_e2de1a1ef001nnAWc8NWbwwHrV","sessionID":"ses_1d21e7bc3ffeNBDAzDp1N8UqTm","messageID":"msg_e2de184d1001jKnOZ4yBaQSP4w"}}
