{"type":"text","timestamp":1778838401317,"sessionID":"ses_1d4f94076ffevtG7L7hQ4e2NO9","part":{"id":"prt_e2b07f115001hjkTQspQ9Aahwm","messageID":"msg_e2b07a6e4001y52toLHl24I5Dc","sessionID":"ses_1d4f94076ffevtG7L7hQ4e2NO9","type":"text","text":"Writing the hypothesis now. It keeps the core behavior fixed and only retimes control-flow arithmetic to shorten the hottest combinational path.","time":{"start":1778838401301,"end":1778838401310},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0d3c422c7207e136016a06eb810a3c819998035a7b47393595","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778838402251,"sessionID":"ses_1d4f94076ffevtG7L7hQ4e2NO9","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_9e9ZWJQZfqrzVkMcxiuxL4Q3","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-001-r1s0.yaml\n+id: hyp-20260515-001-r1s0\n+title: \"Retime control-flow arithmetic\"\n+category: micro_opt\n+motivation: |\n+  The current EX stage recomputes PC-relative and jump-target arithmetic on the same path as branch compare and redirect selection. On a small FPGA like Tang Nano 20K, that wide combinational path is a likely Fmax limiter even when the ISA behavior is already correct.\n+hypothesis: |\n+  Move common control-flow arithmetic earlier in the pipe: carry a precomputed PC+4 value forward from fetch, precompute branch and JALR targets in decode, and let EX only perform the branch compare plus a small target select. This should shorten the EX critical path and raise clock speed without changing retirement semantics.\n+expected_impact:\n+  fitness_delta_pct: 5\n+  confidence: medium\n+changes:\n+  - file: rtl/core_pkg.sv\n+    description: \"Add pipeline-bundle fields for precomputed PC+4 and control-flow targets.\"\n+  - file: rtl/if_stage.sv\n+    description: \"Forward the fetch PC+4 value so EX no longer recomputes it.\"\n+  - file: rtl/id_stage.sv\n+    description: \"Precompute branch and JALR targets alongside decode and latch them into ID/EX.\"\n+  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n+    description: \"Consume the precomputed targets and remove target adders from the EX critical path.\"\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-001-r1s0.yaml","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep1/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-001-r1s0.yaml\n===================================================================\n---