{"type":"text","timestamp":1778871568729,"sessionID":"ses_1d2fe3047ffeNwTumIICkSX4cE","part":{"id":"prt_e2d020819001xjyFDZ5VZwttzh","messageID":"msg_e2d01e88e001xNaPioYt7xf0Bq","sessionID":"ses_1d2fe3047ffeNwTumIICkSX4cE","type":"text","text":"I’ve got the failure modes: wide fetch-side predecode and speculative predictors both hurt more than they helped. I’m now looking for a narrower hot-path tweak that avoids adding IF fanout.","time":{"start":1778871568409,"end":1778871568727},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0d45fb20454bf973016a076d104b48819b96c385440c9f9025","phase":"commentary"}}}}
