{"type":"text","timestamp":1778871609042,"sessionID":"ses_1d2fe3047ffeNwTumIICkSX4cE","part":{"id":"prt_e2d02a666001j75EnsuIH3FTHr","messageID":"msg_e2d028a52001GvS1Cv8rqSkZTR","sessionID":"ses_1d2fe3047ffeNwTumIICkSX4cE","type":"text","text":"I’m writing the hypothesis file now. It keeps the change localized to the memory path and avoids another IF-side fanout experiment.","time":{"start":1778871608934,"end":1778871609040},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_086161e65702b97f016a076d38d3d88198a8f27c82fa1836c3","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778871610179,"sessionID":"ses_1d2fe3047ffeNwTumIICkSX4cE","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_GXgqfRiJ7GBUfT7nRoAp0w33","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-001-r6s0.yaml\n+id: hyp-20260515-001-r6s0\n+title: \"Retimed memory lane metadata\"\n+category: micro_opt\n+motivation: |\n+  The MEM stage still recomputes byte masks, alignment, and load extraction\n+  from the full ALU result on every load/store. On a small FPGA, that keeps\n+  a fairly wide combinational cone on the memory side of the pipe.\n+hypothesis: |\n+  Precompute the load/store lane metadata in EX and carry it through the\n+  EX/MEM payload so MEM only performs the actual bus access plus a much\n+  smaller extract/extend step. This should trim the common memory-path logic\n+  without changing retirement semantics or ISA-visible behavior.\n+expected_impact:\n+  fitness_delta_pct: 5\n+  confidence: medium\n+changes:\n+  - file: rtl/core_pkg.sv\n+    description: \"Add EX/MEM sideband fields for predecoded lane metadata such as alignment, mask, and shift information.\"\n+  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n+    description: \"Compute and latch the memory lane metadata once the effective address is known, instead of re-deriving it in MEM.\"\n+  - file: rtl/mem_stage.sv\n+    description: \"Consume the carried metadata so byte-mask, alignment, and load-extract logic no longer dominate the MEM cone.\"\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-001-r6s0.yaml","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep1/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-001-r6s0.yaml\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep1/cores/bench/experimen