e the best remaining structural bottleneck and the prior failure was from bundle semantics, not the idea itself.\",\"time\":{\"start\":1778884180578,\"end\":1778884180786},\"metadata\":{\"openai\":{\"itemId\":\"msg_03435d16f7c15a5b016a079e546a00819aa894c71e344427da\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}}}}\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1778884180837,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d23e8ff8ffe2Ku6HH4E3kmiaj\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"glob\",\"callID\":\"call_lSecl67WpDKvhcV1FCVz2ULM\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"pattern\":\"cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses\",\"path\":\"/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep1\"},\"output\":\"No files found\",\"metadata\":{\"count\":0,\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"\",\"time\":{\"start\":1778884180810,\"end\":1778884180836}},\"metadata\":{\"openai\":{\"itemId\":\"fc_03435d16f7c15a5b016a079e54a758819a8e63ace56bce074f\"}},\"id\":\"prt_e2dc27b340010MRsR6tUMLonqk\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d23e8ff8ffe2Ku6HH4E3kmiaj\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e2dc18371001XusXPrD6660BEo\"}}\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1778884180858,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d23e8ff8ffe2Ku6HH4E3kmiaj\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"glob\",\"callID\":\"call_rNBRsdkNhf7Q6lDqu9QBFL1L\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"pattern\":\"cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/*.yaml\",\"path\":\"/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep1\"},\"output\":\"No files found\",\"metadata\":{\"count\":0,\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"\",\"time\":{\"start\":1778884180834,\"end\":1778884180856}},\"metadata\":{\"openai\":{\"itemId\":\"fc_03435d16f7c15a5b016a079e54a77c819ab9fc5b423d2bd05e\"}},\"id\":\"prt_e2dc27b4c0012HmszJ2egRf0tC\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d23e8ff8ffe2Ku6HH4E3kmiaj\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e2dc18371001XusXPrD6660BEo\"}}\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1778884180996,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d23e8ff8ffe2Ku6HH4E3kmiaj\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_e2dc27c03001441U6MnME