{"type":"text","timestamp":1778838406132,"sessionID":"ses_1d4f94000ffeEmXslenMBjidpV","part":{"id":"prt_e2b080384001kDuIYOy6vWhUpa","messageID":"msg_e2b07c5fe001181uWlBXjQuZ50","sessionID":"ses_1d4f94000ffeEmXslenMBjidpV","type":"text","text":"I’ve settled on a single structural retiming: move branch-target generation out of EX so the EX→IF redirect cone is shorter, while leaving the ISA-visible branch behavior unchanged. I’m writing that as the hypothesis file now.","time":{"start":1778838406020,"end":1778838406131},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_051f939b9f215346016a06eb85ec4481999782defdd736c967","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778838406859,"sessionID":"ses_1d4f94000ffeEmXslenMBjidpV","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_ezPIZNXodPrP8Qjm6OCxEqER","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-002-r1s1.yaml\n+id: hyp-20260515-002-r1s1\n+title: \"Retime branch target generation\"\n+category: structural\n+motivation: |\n+  The current EX stage computes the taken-branch redirect path and feeds it\n+  straight back into the PC update logic in the same cycle. That creates a\n+  wide EX-to-IF feedback cone that is a natural Fmax limiter on this small\n+  in-order core.\n+hypothesis: |\n+  Precompute the branch/JAL target in ID, carry it as a registered sideband\n+  through the pipeline, and let EX use that latched target instead of\n+  recomputing pc+imm on the critical redirect path. This should shorten the\n+  branch feedback cone without changing branch penalties or architectural\n+  behavior.\n+expected_impact:\n+  fitness_delta_pct: 5\n+  confidence: medium\n+changes:\n+  - file: rtl/core_pkg.sv\n+    description: \"Add a decoded branch-target sideband to the ID/EX bundle so it can be carried forward as a registered value.\"\n+  - file: rtl/id_stage.sv\n+    description: \"Compute and latch pc+imm for branch/JAL instructions during decode, alongside the existing control signals.\"\n+  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n+    description: \"Consume the latched target for branch/JAL redirects and keep only the JALR adder on the live EX critical path.\"\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-002-r1s1.yaml","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep1/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-002-r1s1.yaml\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claud