y; otherwise fall through and let the\\nexisting EX redirect train the entry from the resolved path. Keep JALR and\\nlegality checks off the predictor fast path so the hardware stays small\\nenough for Tang Nano 20K and the formal state stays bounded.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 6, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Thread the resolved PC metadata into IF so the single-entry predictor can train on redirects.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Add the one-entry predictor lookup/update logic and use it to select the next fetch PC.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 6, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Thread the resolved PC metadata into IF so the single-entry predictor can train on redirects.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Add the one-entry predictor lookup/update logic and use it to select the next fetch PC.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 335.7, \"delta_pct... (line truncated to 2000 chars)","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"cores/bench/experiments/log.jsonl","time":{"start":1778869690515,"end":1778869690519}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0d04f33fe42d72a9016a0765ba56748191a39c0348601c39da"}},"id":"prt_e2ce56039002Ej2s8vcHcxJ4hE","sessionID":"ses_1d31b648effeA8mDo9o8jtu6V6","messageID":"msg_e2ce5520f002MH8vbzqcf3rV3G"}}
