s non-branch ALU work on the live execute path.\"\n+  - file: rtl/core.sv\n+    description: \"Rewire redirect control so the ID-stage branch resolver can drive fetch without waiting for EX on B-type branches.\"\n","additions":26,"deletions":0}],"diagnostics":{},"truncated":false},"title":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-002-r5s1.yaml","time":{"start":1778869766907,"end":1778869766909}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_08e7629561012ad4016a0766035c508191a702ab2b2eeb7d5f"}},"id":"prt_e2ce67d6a001onsoDZDIfJVzmN","sessionID":"ses_1d31b648effeA8mDo9o8jtu6V6","messageID":"msg_e2ce63e8d001YxK3h5EK298TBV"}}
