{"type":"text","timestamp":1778838417002,"sessionID":"ses_1d4f93f9bffe3Fp2EelXHrbx2U","part":{"id":"prt_e2b082e40001kDW1oc8Hao3ltw","messageID":"msg_e2b0734bd0012ow1nmnBmtd7s1","sessionID":"ses_1d4f93f9bffe3Fp2EelXHrbx2U","type":"text","text":"I’ve got enough context. I’m writing a narrow static backward-branch predictor hypothesis against the IF/EX control path only.","time":{"start":1778838416960,"end":1778838416978},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_05e3d6823540b90d016a06eb907e488198bc28f95afd0db77f","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778838417596,"sessionID":"ses_1d4f93f9bffe3Fp2EelXHrbx2U","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_LH0QKBc7CUEJwTge7nkfFOcZ","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-003-r1s2.yaml\n+id: hyp-20260515-003-r1s2\n+title: \"Backward branch taken predictor\"\n+category: predictor\n+motivation: |\n+  CoreMark spends a lot of time in tight loops, and this baseline core still\n+  fetches pc+4 until EX resolves every branch. That means each taken backward\n+  loop branch pays a fixed wrong-path flush even though the direction is\n+  obvious from the branch immediate sign bit.\n+hypothesis: |\n+  Add a tiny static predictor in IF that recognizes legal B-type branches and\n+  predicts backward branches taken when the branch immediate is negative.\n+  Recompute the same prediction in EX so correctly predicted branches do not\n+  redirect, and only mispredictions flush the frontend. Keep JAL/JALR as EX-\n+  resolved control flow to avoid introducing a BTB or return stack.\n+expected_impact:\n+  fitness_delta_pct: 8\n+  confidence: medium\n+changes:\n+  - file: rtl/if_stage.sv\n+    description: \"Add static backward-branch prediction in fetch and choose the predicted next PC before EX resolves the branch.\"\n+  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n+    description: \"Compare actual branch outcome against the IF prediction and redirect only on mispredict.\"\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-003-r1s2.yaml","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep1/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-003-r1s2.yaml\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep1/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-003-