d latch pc+imm for branch/JAL instructions during decode, alongside the existing control signals.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Consume the latched target for branch/JAL redirects and keep only the JALR adder on the live EX critical path.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 5, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a decoded branch-target sideband to the ID/EX bundle so it can be carried forward as a registered value.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Compute and latch pc+imm for branch/JAL instructions during decode, alongside the existing control signals.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Consume the latched target for branch/JAL redirects and keep...\n  Line 4: {\"id\": \"hyp-20260515-003-r1s2\", \"title\": \"Backward branch taken predictor\", \"category\": \"predictor\", \"motivation\": \"CoreMark spends a lot of time in tight loops, and this baseline core still\\nfetches pc+4 until EX resolves every branch. That means each taken backward\\nloop branch pays a fixed wrong-path flush even though the direction is\\nobvious from the branch immediate sign bit.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": {\"motivation\": \"CoreMark spends a lot of time in tight loops, and this baseline core still\\nfetches pc+4 until EX resolves every branch. That means each taken backward\\nloop branch pays a fixed wrong-path flush even though the direction is\\nobvious from the branch immediate sign bit.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Add a tiny static predictor in IF that recognizes legal B-type branches and\\npredicts backward branches taken when the branch immediate is negative.\\nRecompute the same prediction in EX so correctly predicted branches do not\\nredirect, and only mispredictions flush the frontend. Keep JAL/JALR as EX-\\nresolved control flow to avoid introducing a BTB or return stack.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 8, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Add static backward-branch prediction in fetch and choose the predicted next PC before EX resolves the branch.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Compare actual branch outcome against the IF prediction and redirect only on mispredict.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 8, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Add static backward-branch prediction in fetch and choose the predicted next PC before EX resolves the branch.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Compare actual branch outcome against the IF prediction and redirect only on mispredict.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 306.86, \"delta_pct\": 8.5, \"vs_baseline\": 8.5, \"fmax_mhz\": 132.24, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4309463, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\"...","metadata":{"matches":3,"truncated":false},"title":"predictor|branch|taken predictor|static backward|BTB|BHT","time":{"start":1778839548996,"end":1778839549020}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_09364d80c7892251016a06effce374819b86ea4b466b380b8f"}},"id":"prt_e2b19743d001qWgXMwcf21k0Wz","sessionID":"ses_1d4e69b92ffe5Xxm2MpEuAdKx0","messageID":"msg_e2b1964f8001hHy6CY2hBJb2mc"}}
