{"type":"text","timestamp":1778864300658,"sessionID":"ses_1d36e77edffeoRsIMElNS5EA6n","part":{"id":"prt_e2c932223001n5E9lfkm10rnb8","messageID":"msg_e2c92a92c0012MMJdsMHw296v5","sessionID":"ses_1d36e77edffeoRsIMElNS5EA6n","type":"text","text":"I’ve narrowed it to a one-register hot-branch cache so the predictor stays tiny enough for the FPGA and the proof budget. Writing the hypothesis file now.","time":{"start":1778864300579,"end":1778864300657},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0f2b460cad6b4c6b016a0750ac705c81988bc6d0cd176c6a0b","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778864301824,"sessionID":"ses_1d36e77edffeoRsIMElNS5EA6n","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_Exm9hT1pYambnU46KPRtkrMX","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-003-r4s2.yaml\n+id: hyp-20260515-003-r4s2\n+title: \"Single-entry loop target cache\"\n+category: predictor\n+motivation: |\n+  CoreMark keeps hitting the same inner-loop branch, but this core still\n+  waits for EX to resolve control flow before it can reuse a taken target.\n+  A predictor that remembers just the hottest resolved transfer can cut\n+  repeated wrong-path fetches without pulling a general BTB or history RAM\n+  into the IF critical path.\n+hypothesis: |\n+  Add a single-entry hot-branch predictor in IF that stores one recently\n+  resolved taken B-type/JAL PC, its target, and a valid bit. On a PC match,\n+  fetch the cached target immediately; otherwise fall through and let the\n+  existing EX redirect train the entry from the resolved path. Keep JALR and\n+  legality checks off the predictor fast path so the hardware stays small\n+  enough for Tang Nano 20K and the formal state stays bounded.\n+expected_impact:\n+  fitness_delta_pct: 6\n+  confidence: medium\n+changes:\n+  - file: rtl/core.sv\n+    description: \"Thread the resolved PC metadata into IF so the single-entry predictor can train on redirects.\"\n+  - file: rtl/if_stage.sv\n+    description: \"Add the one-entry predictor lookup/update logic and use it to select the next fetch PC.\"\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-003-r4s2.yaml","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep1/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-003-r4s2.yaml\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tourna