{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778871629266,"sessionID":"ses_1d2fe2f76ffeLmDxOQPnceYbHn","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_V1wmiVlgkRfSQFA9lme0XHhw","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep1/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260515-003-r5s2.log","offset":1,"limit":200},"output":"<path>/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep1/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260515-003-r5s2.log</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: {\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1778869641528,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_e2ce4a13700165C9FtZBZ2hWl6\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e2ce49d310012PFnyuaDiOhmR8\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"snapshot\":\"61605c3d21850734621f892d595ef30fdf511e40\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n2: {\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1778869644470,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_e2ce4ab9f001Cc2Ldhlx2yEXjP\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e2ce49d310012PFnyuaDiOhmR8\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Reading the recent predictor attempts and lessons first, then I’ll write the hypothesis YAML with the narrowest promising angle.\",\"time\":{\"start\":1778869644191,\"end\":1778869644469},\"metadata\":{\"openai\":{\"itemId\":\"msg_054bd96857926c62016a07658c25fc81919a7dbaf45501ed49\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}}}}\n3: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1778869644519,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"grep\",\"callID\":\"call_ZpApQwpwg5M9zFyuKfWhQUQz\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"pattern\":\"predictor|BTB|branch|loop target|backward-branch\",\"path\":\"/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep1/cores/bench/experiments/log.jsonl\",\"include\":\"*.jsonl\"},\"output\":\"Found 8 matches\\n/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep1/cores/bench/experiments/log.jsonl:\\n  Line 2: {\\\"id\\\": \\\"hyp-20260515-001-r1s0\\\", \\\"title\\\": \\\"Retime control-flow arithmetic\\\", \\\"category\\\": \\\"micro_opt\\\", \\\"motivation\\\": \\\"The current EX stage recomputes PC-relative and jump-target arithmetic on the same path as branch compare and redirect selection. On a small FPGA like Tang Nano 20K, that wide combinational path is a likely Fmax limiter even when the ISA behavior is already correct.\\\\n\\\", \\\"hypothesis\\\": {\\\"motivation\\\": \\\"The current EX stage recomputes PC-relative and jump-target arithmetic on the same path as branch compare and redirect selection. On a small FPGA like Tang Nano 20K, that wide combinational path is a likely Fmax limiter even when the ISA behavior is already correct.\\\\n\\\", \\\"hypothesis\\\": \\\"Move common control-flow arithmetic earlier in the pipe: carry a precomputed PC+4 value forward from fetch, precompute branch and JALR targets in decode, and let EX only perform the branch compare plus a small target select. This should shorten the EX critical path and raise clock speed without changing retirement semantics.\\\\n\\\", \\\"expected_impact\\\": {\\\"fitness_delta_pct\\\": 5, \\\"confidence\\\": \\\"medium\\\"}, \\\"changes\\\": [{\\\"file\\\": \\\"rtl/core_pkg.sv\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Add pipeline-bundle fields for precomputed PC+4 and control-flow targets.\\\"}, {\\\"file\\\": \\\"rtl/if_stage.sv\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Forward the fetch PC+4 value so EX no longer recomputes it.\\\"}, {\\\"file\\\": \\\"rtl/id_stage.sv\\\", \\\"des... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n4: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1778869644523,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_TxqIzvoM5WQDnWckH84kDUkM\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep1/cores/bench/LESSONS.md\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":400},\"output\":\"<path>/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep1/cores/bench/LESSONS.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1:   - 2026-05-15 hyp-20260515-001-r1s0 (broken, n/a): Moving control-flow target math earlier only works if JALR still sees the freshest rs1 value; precomputing jump targets without airtight forwarding/stalling breaks formal on taken-jump semantics.\\n2:   - 2026-05-15 hyp-20260515-002-r1s1 (improvement, +18.70%): Precomputing BRANCH/JAL targets in ID can materially improve Fmax by cutting the EX-to-IF redirect cone, but the live JALR path still has to stay in EX because it depends on forwarded rs1 data.\\n3:   - 2026-05-15 hyp-20260515-003-r1s2 (regression, +8.50%): A tiny static backward-branch predictor can still lose on a loop-heavy benchmark if the branch-immediate decode and legality checks extend the IF critical path more than the saved EX redirect flushes.\\n4:   - 2026-05-15 hyp-20260515-003-r3s2 (broken, n/a): Even a tiny direct-mapped BTB can make formal blow past wall-clock limits, so fetch-side predictor state needs proof-time budgeting as well as performance tuning.\\n\\n(End of file - total 4 lines)\\n</content>\",\"metadata\":{\"preview\":\"  - 2026-05-15 hyp-20260515-001-r1s0 (broken, n/a): Moving control-flow target math earlier only works if JALR still sees the freshest rs1 value; precomputing jump targets without airtight forwarding/stalling breaks formal on taken-jump semantics.\\n  - 2026-05-15 hyp-20260515-002-r1s1 (improvement, +18.70%): Precomputing BRANCH/JAL targets in ID can materially improve Fmax by cutting the EX-to-IF redirect cone, but the live JALR ... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n5: {\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1778869644579,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_e2ce4ad22001faEgQdf206GYD5\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"61605c3d21850734621f892d595ef30fdf511e40\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e2ce49d310012PFnyuaDiOhmR8\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":37720,\"input\":37408,\"output\":190,\"reasoning\":122,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":0}},\"cost\":0}}\n6: {\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1778869645616,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_e2ce4b12e001bBHlTOuLPDilEe\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e2ce4ad4d001YPk6b4BnZXf0Va\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"snapshot\":\"61605c3d21850734621f892d595ef30fdf511e40\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n7: {\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1778869673243,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_e2ce51cb8001DxkiZxR0kIheKP\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e2ce4ad4d001YPk6b4BnZXf0Va\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The prior predictor attempts all failed for the same reasons: too much fetch-path work, or too much predictor state. I’m going to write a bounded predictor hypothesis that keeps IF logic simple and avoids branch-immediate decode on the hot path.\",\"time\":{\"start\":1778869673144,\"end\":1778869673242},\"metadata\":{\"openai\":{\"itemId\":\"msg_0d2c535f83f3be2e016a0765a912d481919c5cf9416e4512be\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}}}}\n8: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1778869673454,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"todowrite\",\"callID\":\"call_Ka1Pidk8RxqNzQfGeCRMjx1A\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"todos\":[{\"content\":\"Review predictor lessons and prior attempts\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"priority\":\"high\"},{\"content\":\"Draft one bounded predictor hypothesis for cores/bench\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"priority\":\"high\"},{\"content\":\"Write the hypothesis YAML file\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"priority\":\"high\"}]},\"output\":\"[\\n  {\\n    \\\"content\\\": \\\"Review predictor lessons and prior attempts\\\",\\n    \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\",\\n    \\\"priority\\\": \\\"high\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"content\\\": \\\"Draft one bounded predictor hypothesis for cores/bench\\\",\\n    \\\"status\\\": \\\"in_progress\\\",\\n    \\\"priority\\\": \\\"high\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"content\\\": \\\"Write the hypothesis YAML file\\\",\\n    \\\"status\\\": \\\"pending\\\",\\n    \\\"priority\\\": \\\"high\\\"\\n  }\\n]\",\"metadata\":{\"todos\":[{\"content\":\"Review predictor lessons and prior attempts\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"priority\":\"high\"},{\"content\":\"Draft one bounded predictor hypothesis for cores/bench\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"priority\":\"high\"},{\"content\":\"Write the hypothesis YAML file\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"priority\":\"high\"}],\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"2 todos\",\"time\":{\"start\":1778869673452,\"end\":1778869673453}},\"metadata\":{\"openai\":{\"itemId\":\"fc_0d2c535f83f3be2e016a0765a9333c8191919353f5383df5b1\"}},\"id\":\"prt_e2ce51d22001cu1oJAp0QYNtwH\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e2ce4ad4d001YPk6b4BnZXf0Va\"}}\n9: {\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1778869673529,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_e2ce51e37001ECj9TV7oQWd1cy\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"61605c3d21850734621f892d595ef30fdf511e40\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e2ce4ad4d001YPk6b4BnZXf0Va\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":44989,\"input\":4347,\"output\":131,\"reasoning\":3135,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":37376}},\"cost\":0}}\n10: {\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1778869681211,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_e2ce53c39001eOCSzXeh1GfXdv\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e2ce51e66001C82VDdDGuWKtAB\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"snapshot\":\"61605c3d21850734621f892d595ef30fdf511e40\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n11: {\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1778869694081,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_e2ce56e22001Oea7OsJ0NpsLZH\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e2ce51e66001C82VDdDGuWKtAB\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Writing the hypothesis now. I’m keeping it to one bounded predictor primitive so it doesn’t repeat the BTB/fetch-path mistakes.\",\"time\":{\"start\":1778869693986,\"end\":1778869694079},\"metadata\":{\"openai\":{\"itemId\":\"msg_0498915980c1062b016a0765bdec588191a0d8fd8fe7acb4d8\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}}}}\n12: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1778869697445,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"apply_patch\",\"callID\":\"call_oaFd9Ena2qbMjetTiuZlNvSj\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"patchText\":\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Add File: cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-003-r5s2.yaml\\n+id: hyp-20260515-003-r5s2\\n+title: \\\"Tiny return-address stack\\\"\\n+category: predictor\\n+motivation: |\\n+  CoreMark and its library calls spend meaningful time in call/return\\n+  traffic, and this core still resolves every JALR return after fetch.\\n+  A bounded return predictor can cut those recurring wrong-path flushes\\n+  without dragging a general BTB or branch-immediate decode into IF.\\n+hypothesis: |\\n+  Add a very small return-address stack that predicts JALR returns from\\n+  the common link-register pattern and trains only on resolved JAL/JALR\\n+  control flow. Keep the predictor state bounded and the fetch-side check\\n+  simple, so IF uses only opcode/rd/rs1 bits already present in the fetched\\n+  instruction while EX remains the source of truth for updates and\\n+  mispredict recovery.\\n+expected_impact:\\n+  fitness_delta_pct: 5\\n+  confidence: medium\\n+changes:\\n+  - file: rtl/if_stage.sv\\n+    description: \\\"Add a tiny return-address stack and use it to choose the predicted next PC for return-like JALR fetches.\\\"\\n+  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\\n+    description: \\\"Generate predictor update metadata from resolved JAL/JALR control flow and redirect on mispredicts.\\\"\\n+  - file: rtl/core.sv\\n+    description: \\\"Thread the predictor update signals between EX and IF without changing the RVFI or memory IO contract.\\\"\\n*** End Patch\"},\"output\":\"Success. Updated the following files:\\nA cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-003-r5s2.yaml\",\"metadata\":{\"diff\":\"Index: /Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep1/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-003-r5s2.yaml\\n=====================================... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n13: {\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1778869697520,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_e2ce57bef001se3Q4x8f779g6h\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"61605c3d21850734621f892d595ef30fdf511e40\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e2ce51e66001C82VDdDGuWKtAB\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":46363,\"input\":553,\"output\":432,\"reasoning\":834,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":44544}},\"cost\":0}}\n14: {\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1778869698400,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_e2ce57f5e001ULf3lo2y2rg4H8\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e2ce57c19001m5RIO7YrjrkL4J\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"snapshot\":\"61605c3d21850734621f892d595ef30fdf511e40\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n15: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1778869699266,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"todowrite\",\"callID\":\"call_3W71Dmb62L29gNwHpbxwtMPU\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"todos\":[{\"content\":\"Review predictor lessons and prior attempts\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"priority\":\"high\"},{\"content\":\"Draft one bounded predictor hypothesis for cores/bench