2ctG1\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Reading the recent predictor attempts and lessons first, then I’ll write the hypothesis YAML with the narrowest promising angle.\",\"time\":{\"start\":1778869644191,\"end\":1778869644469},\"metadata\":{\"openai\":{\"itemId\":\"msg_054bd96857926c62016a07658c25fc81919a7dbaf45501ed49\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}}}}\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1778869644519,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"grep\",\"callID\":\"call_ZpApQwpwg5M9zFyuKfWhQUQz\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"pattern\":\"predictor|BTB|branch|loop target|backward-branch\",\"path\":\"/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep1/cores/bench/experiments/log.jsonl\",\"include\":\"*.jsonl\"},\"output\":\"Found 8 matches\\n/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep1/cores/bench/experiments/log.jsonl:\\n  Line 2: {\\\"id\\\": \\\"hyp-20260515-001-r1s0\\\", \\\"title\\\": \\\"Retime control-flow arithmetic\\\", \\\"category\\\": \\\"micro_opt\\\", \\\"motivation\\\": \\\"The current EX stage recomputes PC-relative and jump-target arithmetic on the same path as branch compare and redirect selection. On a small FPGA like Tang Nano 20K, that wide combinational path is a likely Fmax limiter even when the ISA behavior is already correct.\\\\n\\\", \\\"hypothesis\\\": {\\\"motivation\\\": \\\"The current EX stage recomputes PC-relative and jump-target arithmetic on the same path as branch compare and redirect selection. On a small FPGA like Tang Nano 20K, that wide combinational path is a likely Fmax limiter even when the ISA behavior is already correct.\\\\n\\\", \\\"hypothesis\\\": \\\"Move common control-flow arithmetic earlier in the pipe: carry a precomputed PC+4 value forward from fetch, precompute branch and JALR targets in decode, and let EX only perform the branch compare plus a small target select. This should shorten the EX critical path and raise clock speed without changing retirement semantics.\\\\n\\\", \\\"expected_impact\\\": {\\\"fitness_delta_pct\\\": 5, \\\"confidence\\\": \\\"medium\\\"}, \\\"changes\\\": [{\\\"file\\\": \\\"rtl/core_pkg.sv\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Add pipeline-bundle fields for precomputed PC+4 and control-flow targets.\\\"}, {\\\"file\\\": \\\"rtl/if_stage.sv\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Forward the fetch PC+4 value so EX no longer recomputes it.\\\"}, {\\\"file\\\": \\\"rtl/id_stage.sv\\\", \\\"des... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1778869644523,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_TxqIzvoM5WQDnWckH84kDUkM\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep1/cores/bench/LESSONS.md\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":400},\"output\":\"<path>/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4-mini-rep1/cores/bench/LESSONS.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1:   - 2026-05-15 hyp-20260515-001-r1s0 (broken, n/a): Moving control-flow target math earlier only works if JALR still sees the freshest rs1 value; precomputing jump targets without airtight forwarding/stalling breaks formal on taken-jump semantics.\\n2:   - 2026-05-15 hyp-20260515-002-r1s1 (improvement, +18.70%): Precomputing BRANCH/JAL targets in ID can materially improve Fmax by cutting the EX-to-IF redirect cone, but the live JALR path still has to stay in EX because it depends on forwarded rs1 data.\\n3:   - 2026-05-15 hyp-20260515-003-r1s2 (regression, +8.50%): A tiny static backward-branch predictor can still lose on a loop-heavy benchmark if the branch-immediate decode and legality checks extend the IF critical path more than the saved EX redirect flushes.\\n4:   - 2026-05-15 hyp-20260515-003-r3s2 (broken, n/a): Even a tiny direct-mapped BTB can make formal blow past wall-clock limits, so fetch-side predictor state needs proof-time budgeting as well as performance tuning.\\n\\n(End of file - total 4 lines)\\n</content>\",\"metadata\":{\"preview\":\"  - 2026-05-15 hyp-20260515-001-r1s0 (broken, n/a): Moving control-flow target math earlier only works if JALR still sees the freshest rs1 value; precomputing jump targets without airtight forwarding/stalling breaks formal on taken-jump semantics.\\n  - 2026-05-15 hyp-20260515-002-r1s1 (improvement, +18.70%): Precomputing BRANCH/JAL targets in ID can materially improve Fmax by cutting the EX-to-IF redirect cone, but the live JALR ... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1778869644579,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_e2ce4ad22001faEgQdf206GYD5\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"61605c3d21850734621f892d595ef30fdf511e40\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e2ce49d310012PFnyuaDiOhmR8\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":37720,\"input\":37408,\"output\":190,\"reasoning\":122,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":0}},\"cost\":0}}\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1778869645616,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_e2ce4b12e001bBHlTOuLPDilEe\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e2ce4ad4d001YPk6b4BnZXf0Va\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"snapshot\":\"61605c3d21850734621f892d595ef30fdf511e40\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n{\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1778869673243,\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_e2ce51cb8001DxkiZxR0kIheKP\",\"messageID\":\"msg_e2ce4ad4d001YPk6b4BnZXf0Va\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_1d31b630cffexGQVu9CCN2ctG1\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The prior predictor attempts all failed for the same reasons: too much fetch-path work, or too much predictor state. I’m going to write a bounded predictor hypothesis that keeps IF logic simple and avoids branch-immediate decode on the hot path.\",